    {
     "type": "support_deflection",
     "object": "defl_shidra_shomer",
     "gloss_en": "הכא נמי בשדרה ומשום שומר -- the ear's spine: the shells protect one another. Itself challenged and defended (not representable): the lower grains need the upper? -- בחד דרא (119b.12); an egg-bulk in one row? -- בחיטי דשמעון בן שטח (119b.13); then even one grain (119b.14)",
